# Data — raw downloads and run outputs are NOT redistributed.
# See data/README.md for acquisition. Provenance JSONs under
# data/provenance/ ARE tracked (they back the paper macros).
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/runs/
data/mlruns/
mlruns/
wandb/
# figures/ IS tracked: the paper's figures ship with this repository and the
# drift guard scans them for retracted wording. Scripts write their scratch
# output under data/runs/, which is ignored above.

